# bG REFIT AT THE det3 COLUMN (2026-10-18). Dylan's calls on 10-17: rho_s 5M, --drift-gap-mm 26.5 for det3
# (FRESH_LOOK §21.6: 10 deg extent interpolates to ~26.5 mm; 27.9 = GAP_STUDY, kept as the systematic).
# Fixed: e17 clusters, nc1 calib, tp 166, _cmq, rho5M, gap 26.5, ion reconstructed K0 2.05 (the physical
# parameter; the s1.75 arm is +1.5 % data/sim / -5 ns rise and adds linearly, §21.6, so it is not rerun).
# Scanned: bG {0.43, 0.45, 0.47}. Tags v3k265b<43|45|47>_<ang>.
#
# PRE-REGISTERED (2026-10-18, before submission). Joint = geo. mean of the X and Y p50 data/sim, mean of 5 angles.
# Interpolating 27.9 (0.946) and 26.0 (0.974) at bG 0.47, K0 arm, gives ~0.966 at 26.5 mm; slope ~2 %/0.01 bG (§20.3).
#   * joint: bG 0.47 0.955-0.975, 0.45 0.99-1.02, 0.43 1.02-1.07 -> optimum bG 0.45-0.46.
#   * X/Y split stays: Y/X data/sim 1.08-1.12 at every bG.
#   * inclined RMS extent at 10 deg: 1.44-1.50 mm (data 1.46/1.47), moving < 2 % across bG.
#   * inclined 10-90 % rise and FWHM: within 2 ns across bG; rise ~+12 ns over data at 10 deg.
# FALSIFIER: joint optimum outside 0.44-0.47, or extent/rise moving > 3 % / 3 ns with bG -> bG is not a pure
#   amplitude knob at this column; check the feedback timing before using the refit.
universe                = vanilla
executable              = /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/run_stageBC_w2.sh
log                     = /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/logs/w2.log
request_cpus            = 4
request_memory          = 16000
request_disk            = 12000000
+JobFlavour             = "workday"
MY.SendCredential       = true
environment             = "OMP_NUM_THREADS=4"
arguments               = "rho5M v3k265b$(bt)_$(ang) /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/calib/noise_det3_satscan_feu07_cmq.json /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/clusters_ang_e17/mx17_muons_3k_ang_$(ang)_e17_t0.root '--ion-model reconstructed --ion-mobility K0=2.05 --drift-gap-mm 26.5 --feedback-bg $(bg) --shaper-tp-ns 166 --calib /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/calib/aval_calib_meshfield_nc1_pooled.json'"
output                  = /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/logs/stageBC_v3k265b$(bt)_$(ang).out
error                   = /afs/cern.ch/work/d/dneff/mx17_s1/logs/stageBC_v3k265b$(bt)_$(ang).err
bg = 0.43
bt = 43
queue ang in (th00 thx10 thx20 thy10 thy20)

bg = 0.45
bt = 45
queue ang in (th00 thx10 thx20 thy10 thy20)

bg = 0.47
bt = 47
queue ang in (th00 thx10 thx20 thy10 thy20)
